  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added masked weighted Voronoi partitioning so callers can exclude hexes while retaining a read-only semantic partition result. Added geometry-preserving sampling of Spatial2D integer and floating-point fields, including randomized pointwise field ranges, at hex centers. Added generic and specialized MapValues overloads for source values and partial six-neighbor sets, integer value-mask extraction, and conversions between spatial integer and floating-point maps. Migration note: the minimum Akeldov.Math.Spatial2D dependency is now 1.1.0, with compatible 1.x releases accepted. All changes are additive; expanded documentation and test coverage.",
